@startuml
title Booking and Email Confirmation
actor Student
participant "API Controller" as Controller
participant "Booking Service" as Service
database PostgreSQL
participant "Notification Adapter" as Notify
Student -> Controller : POST /appointments
Controller -> Service : validate and request booking
Service -> PostgreSQL : BEGIN; insert appointment
PostgreSQL --> Service : commit + appointment ID
Service -> Notify : send confirmation
Notify --> Service : sent / failed
Service --> Controller : booking result
Controller --> Student : 201 Created
note over Service,PostgreSQL
Booking commits before email delivery.
Email failure does not cancel the appointment.
end note
@enduml